    "title": "How to Invest 1 Crore With a Serious Allocation Mindset",
    "description": "A practical framework for investing 1 crore across liquidity, income, growth, and hedge buckets instead of overconcentrating in one idea, with Pakistan-focused implementation context.",
    "hero": "🏦",
    "category": "pakistan",
