    "title": "How to Negotiate a Job Offer Without Guessing What to Ask For",
    "description": "A practical guide to negotiating salary, flexibility, and benefits when the offer is close but not strong enough yet, including common Pakistan payroll realities.",
    "hero": "🤝",
