    "slug": "student-group-randomizer-for-teachers",
    "title": "How to Create Balanced Student Groups — A Teacher's Guide",
    "description": "Learn how to split students into fair, skill-balanced groups in seconds. Stop manual sorting and use a free online student group randomizer that also fits large Pakistan-style classrooms.",
    "hero": "🎓",
    "category": "education",
    "section": "decision-support",
    "readTime": "6 min read",
